    "en": {
      "role": "Video Editor",
      "heroLede": "Editing for content creators. Shorts that hook in the first seconds and long-form videos that hold their pace to the end.",
      "aboutBody": "I'm a video editor with a passion for video games and for turning ideas into content that grabs attention and carries real feeling and personality! Over three years of professional work, I've developed a keen eye for pacing, storytelling, aesthetics and trends, along with the flexibility to adapt to different styles and creative directions.",
      "aboutBody2": "My work blends creativity and technique to deliver dynamic, engaging videos that stay true to each project's identity. I'm always looking for new references, sharpening my skills and finding ways to make every edit more compelling and impactful.",
      "aboutExp": "3 years of professional work",
